{
  "version": 2,
  "name": "Water — Prototype",
  "presetMetadata": {
    "id": "WaterPrototype",
    "displayName": "Water — Prototype",
    "category": "Sim",
    "oscPrefix": "waterPrototype",
    "available": true,
    "isLineBased": false,
    "description": "Cutaway basin; hidden front walls still contain the water. Live water demo with a continuous pour and repeated cube dip. The camera starts stationary and can be modulated by the user. If ray tracing is requested, water uses the raster path; transparent objects, temporal upscaling, and volumetric shafts are unsupported. Foam is a deformation-driven visual approximation rendered through the existing raster water path.",
